p23 | (0.0589256 - 0.102062 I) x μu |\n| 10 | 2,1,0 | 12.0000 | 1 | -0.235702 a2^2 mu p32 | -0.235702 y μu |\n| 10 | 2,1,0 | 12.0000 | 2 | 0.235702 a3^2 mu p23 | 0.235702 x μu |\n| 12 | 0,1,2 | 12.0000 | 1 | (-0.0589256 + 0.102062 I) d2^2 mv p23 | (-0.0589256 + 0.102062 I) x μv |\n| 12 | 0,1,2 | 12.0000 | 2 | (0.0589256 - 0.102062 I) d3^2 mv p32 | (0.0589256 - 0.102062 I) y μv |\n| 13 | 0,1,2 | 12.0000 | 1 | (-0.0589256 - 0.102062 I) d2^2 mv p23 | (-0.0589256 - 0.102062 I) x μv |\n| 13 | 0,1,2 | 12.0000 | 2 | (0.0589256 + 0.102062 I) d3^2 mv p32 | (0.0589256 + 0.102062 I) y μv |\n| 14 | 0,1,2 | 12.0000 | 1 | 0.235702 d2^2 mv p23 | 0.235702 x μv |\n| 14 | 0,1,2 | 12.0000 | 2 | -0.235702 d3^2 mv p32 | -0.235702 y μv |\n| 17 | 1,0,1 | 10.3431 | 1 | 0.171126 a2 d2 p23 p32 | 0.171126 x y |\n| 17 | 1,0,1 | 10.3431 | 2 | 0.171126 a3 d3 p23 p32 | 0.171126 x y |\n| 18 | 1,0,1 | 21.6569 | 1 | 0.0271377 a2 d2 p23 p32 | 0.0271377 x y |\n| 18 | 1,0,1 | 21.6569 | 2 | 0.0271377 a3 d3 p23 p32 | 0.0271377 x y |\n| 19 | 1,0,1 | 23.5440 | 1 | (0.0358717 + 0.0286375 I) a2 d2 p23 p32 | (0.0358717 + 0.0286375 I) x y |\n| 19 | 1,0,1 | 23.5440 | 2 | (0.0358717 + 0.0286375 I) a3 d3 p23 p32 | (0.0358717 + 0.0286375 I) x y |\n| 20 | 1,0,1 | 23.5440 | 1 | (0.0358717 - 0.0286375 I) a2 d2 p23 p32 | (0.0358717 - 0.0286375 I) x y |\n| 20 | 1,0,1 | 23.5440 | 2 | (0.0358717 - 0.0286375 I) a3 d3 p23 p32 | (0.0358717 - 0.0286375 I) x y |\n| 21 | 1,0,1 | 6.4560 | 1 | (-0.129924 + 0.0817131 I) a2 d2 p23 p32 | (-0.129924 + 0.0817131 I) x y |\n| 21 | 1,0,1 | 6.4560 | 2 | (-0.129924 + 0.0817131 I) a3 d3 p23 p32 | (-0.129924 + 0.0817131 I) x y |\n| 22 | 1,0,1 | 6.4560 | 1 | (-0.129924 - 0.0817131 I) a2 d2 p23 p32 | (-0.129924 - 0.0817131 I) x y |\n| 22 | 1,0,1 | 6.4560 | 2 | (-0.129924 - 0.0817131 I) a3 d3 p23 p32 | (-0.129924 - 0.0817131 I) x y |\n\nExact values for the states with rational energy: `[1,2,1]`: `-1/3 mv mu`; `[2,0,2]` (E=8): `c = (-1 + i)/sqrt(24)` (|c|^2 = 1/12) for both structures; `[2,1,0